#: input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md:215
msgid ""
"The following extension are to be used in accordance to [2, Section 5]:"
msgstr "تُستخدم الامتدادات التالية وفقاً لـ [2, Section 5]:"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md#L221
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_certificate_governance.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_certificate_governance.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md:221
msgid ""
"The following extensions are to be used as defined in [2, Appendix A4]. "
"Countries MAY also include an extendedKeyUsage entry with zero or more (i.e."
" up to 3) entries from:"
msgstr ""
"تُستخدم الامتدادات التالية على النحو المحدد في [2, Appendix A4]. ويجوز "
"للبلدان أيضاً أن تُدرج مُدخَل extendedKeyUsage يتضمن صفراً أو أكثر من "
"المدخلات (أي ما يصل إلى 3) من بين ما يلي:"

