msgstr "شهادات التحميل (TNPUP)"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md#L123
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_certificate_governance.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_certificate_governance.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md:123
msgid "Upload: 1-2 years"
msgstr "التحميل: سنة إلى سنتان"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md#L51
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_certificate_governance.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_certificate_governance.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md:51
msgid ""
"Uploaded data packages are provided by the TNG “as is”, meaning that the TNG"
" does not add or delete DSCs from the packages it receives. The Backend "
"systems of the GDHCN Participants shall be enabled to verify the end-to-end "
"integrity and authenticity of the uploaded data (see Section \"Integrity and"
" authenticity of uploaded data\")."
msgstr ""
"تقدم TNG حزم البيانات المحمَّلة “كما هي”، أي أن TNG لا تضيف شهادات DSC إلى "
"الحزم التي تتلقاها ولا تحذفها منها. ويجب تمكين النظم الخلفية للمشاركين في "
"GDHCN من التحقق من سلامة البيانات المحمَّلة وأصالتها من طرف إلى طرف (انظر "
"القسم \"سلامة البيانات المحمَّلة وأصالتها\")."

