#: input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md:36
msgid ""
"|Certificate|\tOr public key certificate. An X.509 v3 certificate that "
"contains the public key of an entity |EC-DSA|\tElliptic Curve Digital "
"Signature Algorithm. A cryptographic signature algorithm based on elliptic "
"curves |mTLS|\tMutual TLS. The Transport Layer Security Protocol with mutual"
" authentication |RSA|\tAsymmetric cryptographic algorithm based on integer "
"factorization used for digital signatures or asymmetric encryption"
msgstr ""
"|الشهادة|\tأو شهادة المفتاح العام. شهادة X.509 v3 تحتوي على المفتاح العام "
"لكيان ما |EC-DSA|\tخوارزمية التوقيع الرقمي بالمنحنيات الإهليلجية. خوارزمية "
