#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/license.md#L18
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/license.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/license.html
#: input/pagecontent/license.md:18
