#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/trust_domains.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/trust_domains.html
#: input/pagecontent/trust_domains.md:53
msgid ""
"The Pan-American Highway for Digital Health (PH4H) implementation guide "
